// depends-on-plugin com.intellij.java
// depends-on-plugin org.intellij.groovy
//
// Script-variable bindings (LivePlugin script).
//
// WHAT IT DOES
//   Reads bindings.json (next to this file, generated by /kgy generate-typings
//   from the runtime binding snapshot, keyed by script side) and teaches the
//   editor the implicit script variables, e.g. $Item, $StartupEvents, SECOND.
//   Two mechanisms, both side-gated by file path (startup_scripts,
//   server_scripts, client_scripts):
//     variables  a NonCodeMembersContributor emits the instance and
//                event-group bindings of the file's side as implicit
//                GrDynamicImplicitProperty values, so they resolve with no
//                imports (event groups as EventGroupBinding, instances as T).
//                Class values are deliberately skipped here: a bare
//                java.lang.Class helps nothing in scripts.
//     completion a CompletionContributor offers the class-value bindings; on
//                accept it inserts `import <FQN> as <alias>` (text-based, like
//                type-suggestions) so the $ name also works explicitly.
//
// LOOKUP / COST
//   Entries are indexed once per file change into Map<side, List<entry>>;
//   both providers bail fast outside KubeGroovy script dirs, on qualified
//   references, or when nameHint matches nothing.
//
// RUNNING IT
//   compile.bat checks it compiles; install.bat copies script + json to
//   LivePlugin; reload it from the LivePlugin tool window.

